ituting this into the third equation, gives\n\n$$\n-\\frac{{a}_{n}n\\pi }{3}-5(\\frac{15{a}_{n}}{n\\pi })=\\frac{2(-1)^{n+1}}{n\\pi }\\,⇒\\,{a}_{n}=\\frac{6(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}+225}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, for ${a}_{n}$ with $n\\ge 1,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{n} & =\\frac{15{a}_{n}}{n\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{15}{n\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{6(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}+225} \\\\  & =\\frac{90(-1)^{n}}{n\\pi ({n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}+225)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our particular solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{p}∼1 & +{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\,\\frac{6(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}+225}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}) \\\\  & +{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\,\\frac{90(-1)^{n}}{n\\pi ({n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}+225)}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397677 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397678 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397677 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397679 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397677 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397680 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397677 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397681 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397677 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397677 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397677 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186397679 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397677 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "dfa212b9-4a9e-5ed1-977d-8a0f92f187bb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397678 #edb/ref 1080 "2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397678 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397678 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "f5beaf63-a24e-5096-a60c-b0469d5c3b91" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397679 #edb/ref 1080 "1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397679 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397679 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "abc5583a-c2d4-5270-9535-e8dc76611c8d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186397680 #edb/ref 1080 "-1" #edb/ref 17592